# Derpseek lossy-fast-prefill (exact-fast-prefill before 1.4): lossy-fast with more of the experts that prompts use in
# GPU memory. Layers 0-19 run every prompt token, layers 20-39 only the last 128 rows of a prompt, so this rowmap keeps
# 256 static + 96 cache rows in layers 0-19 and 128 + 96 in layers 20-39 (the same 11,520 HBM rows). lil-bench prompt
# reading 69-75K tok/s (dsv41: 75K; lossy-fast 63-70K), decode 3-4% below lossy-fast.
ROWMAP=${ROWMAP:-exact-splitB-mm.json}
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/lossy-fast.env"
